flowchart TB
  ADMIN([Admin opens /admin]) --> GUARD{ADMIN_EMAILS<br/>or ADMIN_UIDS?}
  GUARD -->|no| DENY[403 — not authorized]
  GUARD -->|yes| QUEUE[Load open issues<br/>filter by department]

  QUEUE --> PICK[Select issue]
  PICK --> ACTION{Action}

  ACTION -->|status update| STATUS[PATCH status:<br/>Assigned / In Progress / Resolved]
  ACTION -->|proof upload| PROOF[Upload proof image<br/>issues/id/proof.ext]
  ACTION -->|reopen| REOPEN[Reporter reopen flow]

  STATUS --> NOTIFY[notifyStatusChange<br/>→ notifications collection]
  PROOF --> RESOLVED[Set status Resolved<br/>resolvedAt timestamp]
  RESOLVED --> MATCH[Optional: Gemini before/after<br/>Model F stretch]
  MATCH --> PTS[+25 pts reporter<br/>Verified Voice badge]

  NOTIFY --> EVENT[events/status_change]
  PTS --> EVENT
  EVENT --> TIMELINE[Issue detail timeline updated]
  TIMELINE --> DASH[Dashboard resolved count++]

  subgraph sla["SLA monitoring"]
    QUEUE --> BREACH{slaDeadline passed?}
    BREACH -->|yes| ESC[Flag slaBreached<br/>admin analytics alert]
  end
